      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَامَمْتُهُ</span></b>  signifies <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَمَمْتُهُ وَغَمَّنِى</span> [<i>I grieved him,</i>
